 "description": "Minimal preparation. The Rizia border is held only by infantry and militia (one unit per border province); the inner line Marenta - north of Nanta (21-17-13-8-97) is unmanned. Zille has 2 tanks right behind the front (Zille North 31, Portoserra Southeast 113), a small mechanized pair near Wiktrany (110, 24) and, in the rear behind the inner line, mountain infantry in the Quella Highlands (100) with a mechanized pair (99, 98). Most units are in continental Wehlen; tanks and mechanized stand in small groups of 2 adjacent provinces (tanks 74-76 and 82-87, mechanized 75-78 and 90-91). The fleet is a set of thin one-ship lines (S25/S22/S18 in front of the Rizian east seas, S12/S16 at Munat, S29/S35 in the Isor-Rotsla channel, S55/S54 in front of the Rizian west seas); the flagship lies in Kreleck Sound (S1) next to the capital Kratsna.",
